### WatchJobs: roteiro de testes da API
### Sem a extensão REST Client, use o Swagger: http://localhost:8081/swagger-ui.html
### O código de redefinição aparece no Mailpit: http://localhost:8025
### Execute na ordem. Rodando de novo, o signup da Ana responde 409: siga a partir do signin.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081

### 1. Cadastro (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Ana",
  "lastName": "Silva",
  "birthDate": "1995-05-10",
  "email": "ana@teste.com",
  "password": "senha1234",
  "confirmPassword": "senha1234"
}

### 2. Cadastro com e-mail repetido (409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Ana",
  "lastName": "Silva",
  "birthDate": "1995-05-10",
  "email": "ANA@teste.com",
  "password": "senha1234",
  "confirmPassword": "senha1234"
}

### 3. Cadastro inválido (400 com as mensagens de validação)
POST {{baseUrl}}/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "",
  "lastName": "Silva",
  "birthDate": "2999-01-01",
  "email": "nao-e-email",
  "password": "abc",
  "confirmPassword": "abc"
}

### 4. Senha diferente da confirmação (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Ana",
  "lastName": "Silva",
  "birthDate": "1995-05-10",
  "email": "outra@teste.com",
  "password": "senha1234",
  "confirmPassword": "senha9999"
}

### 5. Login (200 + token)
# @name signin
POST {{baseUrl}}/signin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ana@teste.com",
  "password": "senha1234"
}

###
@token = {{signin.response.body.token}}

### 6. Login com senha errada (401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/signin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ana@teste.com",
  "password": "errada123"
}

### 7. Rota protegida sem token (401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/me

### 8. Rota protegida com token (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Etapas da candidatura (200, 6 etapas)
GET {{baseUrl}}/application-stages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------------- SavedJob ----------------

### 10. Criar vaga (201)
# @name createJob
POST {{baseUrl}}/saved-jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "positionRole": "Desenvolvedor Kotlin",
  "organizationName": "ACME Tecnologia",
  "jobUrl": "https://acme.example/vagas/123",
  "locationCity": "São Paulo",
  "locationState": "SP",
  "locationCountryCode": "BR",
  "workMode": "HYBRID",
  "experienceLevel": "MID",
  "jobType": "CLT",
  "salaryMin": 8000.00,
  "salaryMax": 12000.00,
  "salaryCurrency": "BRL",
  "status": "SAVED",
  "notes": "Indicação de um amigo"
}

###
@jobId = {{createJob.response.body.id}}

### 11. Criar outra vaga (201), usada no teste da cascata
# @name createJob2
POST {{baseUrl}}/saved-jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "positionRole": "Analista de Dados",
  "organizationName": "Globex",
  "workMode": "REMOTE",
  "status": "PLANNING_TO_APPLY"
}

###
@jobId2 = {{createJob2.response.body.id}}

### 12. Vaga inválida (400 com as mensagens de validação)
POST {{baseUrl}}/saved-jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "positionRole": "",
  "organizationName": "ACME",
  "locationCountryCode": "bra",
  "salaryMin": -10,
  "salaryCurrency": "real",
  "status": "SAVED"
}

### 13. Salário mínimo maior que o máximo (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/saved-jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "positionRole": "Dev",
  "organizationName": "ACME",
  "salaryMin": 15000,
  "salaryMax": 9000,
  "status": "SAVED"
}

### 14. Listar vagas (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/saved-jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 15. Buscar vagas com LIKE em cargo ou empresa (200, só a do Kotlin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/saved-jobs?q=kotl
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 16. Vaga por id (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/saved-jobs/{{jobId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 17. Vaga inexistente (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/saved-jobs/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 18. Atualizar vaga (200)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/saved-jobs/{{jobId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "positionRole": "Desenvolvedor Kotlin Pleno",
  "organizationName": "ACME Tecnologia",
  "locationCity": "São Paulo",
  "locationState": "SP",
  "locationCountryCode": "BR",
  "workMode": "REMOTE",
  "experienceLevel": "MID",
  "jobType": "CLT",
  "salaryMin": 9000.00,
  "salaryMax": 13000.00,
  "salaryCurrency": "BRL",
  "status": "PLANNING_TO_APPLY",
  "notes": "Salário revisado"
}

### ---------------- Application ----------------

### 19. Criar candidatura (201). A vaga passa para APPLIED
# @name createApp
POST {{baseUrl}}/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "savedJobId": {{jobId}},
  "stageId": 1,
  "status": "APPLIED",
  "applicationDate": "2026-10-15",
  "interviewAt": "2026-10-20T14:30:00",
  "notes": "Enviado pelo site da empresa"
}

###
@appId = {{createApp.response.body.id}}

### 20. Conferir que a vaga virou APPLIED (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/saved-jobs/{{jobId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 21. Segunda candidatura na mesma vaga (409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "savedJobId": {{jobId}},
  "stageId": 1,
  "status": "APPLIED",
  "applicationDate": "2026-10-15"
}

### 22. Candidatura inválida (400 com as mensagens de validação)
POST {{baseUrl}}/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "savedJobId": 0,
  "stageId": 1,
  "status": "SAVED",
  "applicationDate": "2999-01-01"
}

### 23. Listar candidaturas (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 24. Buscar candidaturas com LIKE em notas, feedback, cargo ou empresa (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/applications?q=acme
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 25. Candidatura por id (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/applications/{{appId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 26. Atualizar candidatura para IN_PROCESS (200). A vaga acompanha
PUT {{baseUrl}}/applications/{{appId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "savedJobId": {{jobId}},
  "stageId": 2,
  "status": "IN_PROCESS",
  "applicationDate": "2026-10-15",
  "interviewAt": "2026-10-22T10:00:00",
  "notes": "Passei na triagem",
  "feedback": "Retorno positivo do RH"
}

### 27. Conferir que a vaga virou IN_PROCESS (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/saved-jobs/{{jobId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 28. Voltar a vaga para SAVED com candidatura existente (409)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/saved-jobs/{{jobId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "positionRole": "Desenvolvedor Kotlin Pleno",
  "organizationName": "ACME Tecnologia",
  "status": "SAVED"
}

### 29. Excluir candidatura (204). A vaga volta para SAVED
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/applications/{{appId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 30. Conferir que a vaga voltou para SAVED (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/saved-jobs/{{jobId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 31. Candidatura na segunda vaga (201)
# @name createApp2
POST {{baseUrl}}/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "savedJobId": {{jobId2}},
  "stageId": 1,
  "status": "APPLIED",
  "applicationDate": "2026-10-16"
}

###
@appId2 = {{createApp2.response.body.id}}

### 32. Excluir a segunda vaga (204). A candidatura some junto (cascata)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/saved-jobs/{{jobId2}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 33. Conferir que a candidatura sumiu (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/applications/{{appId2}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------------- Isolamento entre usuários ----------------

### 34. Cadastrar o segundo usuário (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Bruno",
  "lastName": "Souza",
  "birthDate": "1990-01-20",
  "email": "bruno@teste.com",
  "password": "senha1234",
  "confirmPassword": "senha1234"
}

### 35. Login do segundo usuário (200)
# @name signinBruno
POST {{baseUrl}}/signin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "bruno@teste.com",
  "password": "senha1234"
}

###
@tokenBruno = {{signinBruno.response.body.token}}

### 36. O Bruno não vê as vagas da Ana (200, lista vazia)
GET {{baseUrl}}/saved-jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenBruno}}

### 37. O Bruno tenta abrir a vaga da Ana (404, e não 403)
GET {{baseUrl}}/saved-jobs/{{jobId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenBruno}}

### 38. O Bruno tenta excluir a vaga da Ana (404)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/saved-jobs/{{jobId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenBruno}}

### ---------------- Renovacao e logout (PostgreSQL) ----------------

### 39. Renovar a sessao da Ana sem access token (200 com novo par)
# @name refreshAna
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{signin.response.body.refreshToken}}"
}

### 40. Reutilizar o refresh antigo (401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{signin.response.body.refreshToken}}"
}

### 41. Usar o access renovado (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{refreshAna.response.body.token}}

### 42. Logout sem access (401, sem revogar)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshAna.response.body.refreshToken}}"
}

### 43. Bruno tenta revogar a sessao da Ana (401, sem revogar)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenBruno}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshAna.response.body.refreshToken}}"
}

### 44. Logout da sessao renovada (204)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{refreshAna.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshAna.response.body.refreshToken}}"
}

### 45. Renovar depois do logout (401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshAna.response.body.refreshToken}}"
}

### ---------------- Recuperacao de senha e exclusao ----------------
### O codigo de 6 digitos aparece no Mailpit: http://localhost:8025

### 46. Pedir codigo para e-mail inexistente (202, sem e-mail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/password/forgot
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nao-existe@teste.com"
}

### 47. Pedir codigo da Ana (202). Copie o codigo do Mailpit para @code abaixo.
POST {{baseUrl}}/password/forgot
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ana@teste.com"
}

###
@code = 000000

### 48. Redefinir a senha (204). Troque @code pelo valor do Mailpit.
POST {{baseUrl}}/password/reset
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ana@teste.com",
  "code": "{{code}}",
  "newPassword": "senha5678",
  "confirmPassword": "senha5678"
}

### 49. Login com a senha nova (200)
# @name signinNova
POST {{baseUrl}}/signin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ana@teste.com",
  "password": "senha5678"
}

###
@tokenNovo = {{signinNova.response.body.token}}

### 50. Excluir a conta com senha errada (401, a conta continua)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNovo}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password": "errada123"
}

### 51. Excluir a conta (204)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNovo}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password": "senha5678"
}

### 52. A conta nao existe mais (401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNovo}}

### ---------------- Corpus: Buscar vagas (F2) ----------------
### Rode antes o motor (README 7.3) para haver vagas. Usa o login do Bruno (passo 35).

### 53. Buscar vagas no corpus (200 com { items, page, size, total })
# @name searchJobs
GET {{baseUrl}}/jobs/search?q=engineer&size=5
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenBruno}}

###
@corpusJobId = {{searchJobs.response.body.items[0].id}}

### 54. Filtros: remoto e sênior (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/jobs/search?workMode=REMOTE&level=SENIOR&location=brazil
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenBruno}}

### 55. Filtro inválido (400 INVALID_PARAMETER)
GET {{baseUrl}}/jobs/search?workMode=MARTE
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenBruno}}

### 56. Detalhe da vaga com skills (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/jobs/{{corpusJobId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenBruno}}

### 57. Salvar a vaga do corpus (201): a cópia em /saved-jobs não expira
POST {{baseUrl}}/jobs/{{corpusJobId}}/save
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenBruno}}

### 58. Salvar de novo (409 "Você já salvou esta vaga")
POST {{baseUrl}}/jobs/{{corpusJobId}}/save
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenBruno}}

### 59. A vaga salva aparece na lista (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/saved-jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenBruno}}
